@startuml 6-range-sync
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
title Range sync (BlockRangeSync): order kept, memory bounded
participant "Node" as N
participant "Main connection\n(BlockFetch)" as C
participant "Ordered queue\n(max 256)" as B
participant "Leios connection" as R
participant "App" as P

C -> N : BlockFetch RequestRange(from, to)
N -> C : RB 100, RB 101 (announces X)
C -> B : RB 100, RB 101
B -> P : onBlock(100), onBlock(101)
N -> C : RB 102 (certifies X), RB 103, RB 104 (certifies Y), RB 105
C -> B : RB 102..105
B -> R : fetch X and Y (started on arrival)
note over B : 102 waits for X;\n103..105 wait behind it
R -> N : LeiosFetch for X, then Y
N -> R : EB X + transactions, EB Y + transactions
R -> B : X ready
B -> P : onBlock(102 + X), onBlock(103)
R -> B : Y ready
B -> P : onBlock(104 + Y), onBlock(105)
note over C, B
  When the queue is full, the main connection's thread waits:
  Yaci reads from the node more slowly (back-pressure).
  EB answers still arrive, on the other connection.
end note
B -> P : batchDone() after the last block, same ordered queue
@enduml
